{"id":"hur","name":"Hur","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:hur"],"types":[{"type":"person","from":"UBS: Names of People"}],"standing":"single-index","indexes":["nave"],"thin":false,"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Hur","text":"A hole, as of a viper, etc. (1.) A son of Caleb (1 Chr. 2:19, 50; 4:1, 4; comp. 2 Chr. 1:5). (2.) The husband of Miriam, Moses’ sister (Ex. 17:10-12). He was associated with Aaron in charge of the people when Moses was absent on Sinai (Ex. 24:14). He was probably of the tribe of Judah, and grandfather of Bezaleel (Ex. 31:2; 35:30; 1 Chr. 2:19). (3.) One of the five princes of Midian who were defeated and slain by the Israelites under the command of Phinehas (Num. 31:8)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2354","lemma":"חוּר","xlit":"Chûwr","gloss":"Chur, the name of four Israelites and one Midianite","kjv":"Hur","count":15,"share":0.94},{"strong":"H4294","lemma":"מַטֶּה","xlit":"maṭṭeh","gloss":"a branch","kjv":"rod, staff, tribe","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":9,"share":0.56},{"strong":"H8034","lemma":"שֵׁם","xlit":"shêm","gloss":"an appellation, as amark or memorial of individuality","kjv":"base, fame, named, renown","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H3427","lemma":"יָשַׁב","xlit":"yâshab","gloss":"to sit down","kjv":"abide, continue, dwell, ease self","count":3,"share":0.19}],"verses":["Exod.17.10","Exod.17.12","Exod.24.14","Exod.31.2","Exod.35.30","Exod.38.22","Num.31.8","Josh.13.21","1Chr.2.19","1Chr.2.20","1Chr.2.50","1Chr.4.1","1Chr.4.4","2Chr.1.5","Neh.3.9","1Kgs.4.8"],"witnesses":["n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n"],"agreed":0,"broader":[],"narrower":[],"related":[{"id":"ephratah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.136,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"bezalel","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.097,"why":"3 verses are index